# Hey, I'm Lucas 👋

### Product Builder · Developer · Designer · Creator

I build digital products, experiment with ideas, and turn concepts into real apps.

I'm the creator of **[LuckiApps](https://luckiapps.com)** — my main project and portfolio — where I design and develop apps, tools, experiments, and products across web, mobile, and desktop.

I care about more than just making something *work*.
I like thinking about the **product, design, experience, branding, architecture, and the reason why it should exist**.

