## 🧠 About me

* 🇦🇷 Based in Argentina
* 🚀 Building products for around **4 years**
* 🧪 Created dozens of apps, prototypes, tools, and experiments
* 🎨 UI/UX, product design, branding & frontend
* ⚙️ APIs, integrations, databases & backend logic
* 🤖 Heavy believer in **AI-assisted development**
